/*=============================================================================
	VolumetricFog.usf
	5.7-compatible version with custom volumetric fog modes from ShaderShift:
	- Phase function dispatcher (HG / Schlick / Cornette-Shanks / Dual-Lobe HG / Mie-Approx)
	- Schneider 2015 powder term in the integration pass
	- R2 quasirandom sub-voxel jitter (more uniform than the engine PCG hash)
=============================================================================*/

